    "language": "en-US",
    "notes": "The simplest kind of menu: the film's TMDB backdrop (the viewer's browser fetches it from TMDB; nothing is hosted here), dimmed, with a plain list of buttons. No layout, no art files. Extras are illustrative, not a real disc listing. Its Scene Selection uses the built-in default screen: a 3x3 grid with six chapters per page. Also: fade transition and built-in click sounds."
  },
